oth</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Follow</span></span><span class=\"on_unfollow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Following Isleroth</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Following</span></span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=add_to_collection&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fisleroth.itch.io%2Fbeyond-the-10th\" class=\"action_btn add_to_collection_btn\"><svg aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_collection_add2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" role=\"img\"><path d=\"M 1,6 H 14\" /><path d=\"M 1,11 H 14\" /><path d=\"m 1,16 h 9\" /><path d=\"M 18,11 V 21\" /><path d=\"M 13,16 H 23\" /></svg><span class=\"full_label\">Add To Collection</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Collection</span></a></li><li class=\"community_link\"><a href=\"https://isleroth.itch.io/beyond-the-10th#comments\" class=\"action_btn\"><svg aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_comment\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" role=\"img\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\" /></svg>Comments</a></li><li><a data-label=\"related_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/4973574/beyond-the-10th\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_merriweather-sans\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img alt=\"Beyond The 10th - Demo\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5ODgyNjc3LnBuZw==/original/1rWZdu.png\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Beyond The 10th - Demo</h1></div><div class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget direct_download\" id=\"view_game_1322484\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable Beyond The 10th</p><div class=\"direct_download_row\"><button class=\"button direct_download_btn\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_download\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" role=\"img\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg> Download</button></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p>Beyond the 10th is a first-person psychological horror game built around anomaly detection.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMjg5NTA2LmdpZg==/original/V3RSF0.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><span></span></p>\r\n<p><br><strong>HOW IT WORKS</strong>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Your soul is trapped somewhere between life and death, endlessly tormented by a relentless wraith\r\n</p>\r\n<p>The demo shows the full Hospital map, you have to study every object and decide if something has changed or not by choosing one of two doors.</p>\r\n<p>Get it right and you move forward. Get it wrong and you start over from the beginning.\r\n </p>\r\n<p>Every time you fail, the game shows you what you missed, so you learn as you go.\r\n </p>\r\n<p>Anomalies and jumpscares are randomized each run, so every attempt feels different.\r\n</p>\r\n<figure><img style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMjg5NjMzLmdpZg==/original/Ev4Bxi.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\r\n<p><strong>YOU ARE NOT ALONE</strong></p>\r\n<p>The wraith is not your only threat, mannequins, dolls, and the undead will harass and distract you while you search for the truth.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Expect jumpscares, so stay sharp.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMjg5NjgyLmdpZg==/original/wwoS9%2B.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p><strong>WHAT&#x27;S INCLUDED IN THE DEMO</strong></p>\r\n<ul><li>Hospital map\r\n</li><li>Randomized anomalies and jumpscares each run\r\n</li><li>A variety of enemies\r\n</li><li>Full English and Spanish support\r\n</li></ul>\r\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMjg5Njk5LmdpZg==/original/d%2BxCKj.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>WHAT&#x27;S INCLUDED IN THE FULL GAME</strong>\r\n</p>\r\n<ul><li>4 distinct maps: a hospital, an abandoned station, a cabin in the woods, and a hotel\r\n</li><li>Over 120 anomalies\r\n</li><li>Randomized anomalies and jumpscares each run\r\n</li><li>Multiple difficulty options\r\n</li><li>A variety of enemies\r\n</li><li>Full English and Spanish support\r\n</li></ul></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"toggle_info_btn\">More information<svg aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" width=\"12\" height=\"6\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\" id